      "reason": "exact-image probe of the guarded IMDb path, an idle window, and a run that logs \"Finished Run\" (Kometa exits 0 after a startup abort)",
      "source": "autoMerge.json5 kometa carve-out; OP513 comment 6182"
    },
    {
      "id": "comfyui-render",
      "match": {
